      * TextOutput (missing documentation) => ..., default value "Quiet", 
  * Outputs:
      * cmv, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, the Chern-Mather volumes of the
        projective toric variety X_A, ordered from dimension X_A to dimension
